# Phase 03 — Auth

## Goal

Implement Supabase auth flows with secure session persistence, protected routes, and post-login gym/role loading.

## Tasks

- Login, logout, forgot password.
- Session persistence with SecureStore.
- Protected routes (auth-gated groups).
- Friendly, actionable error messages.
- Load gym and role after login (from verified server data, not client `gym_id`).
- Auth-related tests.

## Done when

- [ ] Login / logout / forgot password work
- [ ] Session persists via SecureStore
- [ ] Unauthenticated users cannot reach protected screens
- [ ] Gym and role load correctly after login
- [ ] Friendly errors shown for common failures
- [ ] Tests pass (lint, typecheck, tests)

Update BUILD_STATUS.md, then stop and wait for me.
